This project is a Rust port, for one device family, of the TPAP transport written
for python-kasa by ZeliardM and contributors:

  https://github.com/python-kasa/python-kasa/pull/1592

python-kasa is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later. The protocol logic (message flow, key
derivation, transcript layout, SPAKE2+ constants) follows that implementation,
which is why this project carries the same license. Its test vectors were
generated by running that implementation (see tests/tools/gen_vectors.py).

